==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Parasol Base (Enemy Base)|Parasol Base]].
*Infinite [[Dark Wind]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 50~53.33 seconds<sup>1,500f~1,600f</sup>.
*10 [[Kroxo]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*8 [[White Wind]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*2 [[Helmut Krabbe]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>.
*8 [[Dark Wind]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Imperator Sael]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.
*6 [[White Wind]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*2 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.

